# sha256 of every file the Kimi-K3.1 true-on-policy patches change (after all patches are applied) and of every
# plugin file. Paths starting with vllm/ are relative to the site-packages directory that holds vllm, experimental/
# to /opt/Megatron-LM, kimi-k31/ to /opt/k31-plugins. docker/rocm/Dockerfile.rocm.kimi-k31.true-on-policy checks
# them at build time (sha256sum -c).
# The comment above each entry is the md5 of that file in the validated runs. Where it differs from the shipped file,
# only comments and docstrings differ (Python AST with docstrings stripped is identical), except in experimental/lite/megatron/lite/primitive/kernels/rocm_k31.py:
# there, three string constants were also made neutral: the return value of _bi_lora_epilogue (now "default";
# its only caller discards it) and two RuntimeError messages. Behavior-neutral.

